These files drive, patch in memory and restate parts of Genie 3 (https://github.com/aqlaboratory/genie3 at commit
d77ae5ac04212ff1e8b29b585859a3244c614804, version 0.0.1), which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; upstream's LICENSE
prints no copyright line of its own (the appendix template line only) and the upstream repository has no NOTICE file at that commit. To the extent they contain
modified copies or restatements of upstream code they are derivative works under that licence. Modified upstream material, per file
(Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)):

  fast_inference/driver/g3fast_patches.py   modified copies of batched_gather (src/genie3/generation/utils/tensor_utils.py),
                                            quat_to_rot (src/genie3/generation/utils/affine_utils.py), sinusoidal_encoding
                                            (src/genie3/generation/utils/encode_utils.py) and _compute_frenet_frames
                                            (src/genie3/generation/utils/geo_utils.py); re-executes the source of
                                            V1PairFeatureNet.forward (src/genie3/generation/model/embedder/pair/v1.py) with one
                                            expression replaced, in memory, at run time
  fast_inference/driver/g3fast.py           restates DDIMSampler._step and its step schedule
                                            (src/genie3/generation/diffusion/sampler/ddim.py, sampler.py), the set-up order of
                                            src/genie3/generation/workflow.py and runner/runner.py, and the call order of the
                                            denoiser forward (src/genie3/generation/model/implementation/v1.py)
  g3cap/g3cap.py, g3cap/g3lean.py            restate V1PairFeatureNet.forward (model/embedder/pair/v1.py), LatentTransformer and
                                            LatentTransformerBlock.forward (model/latent/transformer.py) and
                                            TriangleMultiplicativeUpdate.forward (model/module/triangular_multiplicative_update.py)

